.TH geectl-local-build-periodic-install 1  "geectl-local-build-periodic-install 0.2.4" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-local\-build\-periodic\-install \- Install the daily periodic cleanup for this platform: write the scheduler entry and enable it. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the install
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl local\-build periodic\-install\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install the daily periodic cleanup for this platform: write the scheduler entry and enable it. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the install
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.4
